## ── UI Info Panels ────────────────────────────────────────────
ui.projectbee:info.advance_beehive=§eAdvance Beehive§r\nAn automated beehive that processes\nbee products and produces honeycombs.\n\n§bBee Input§r — Insert a filled bee cage\n§bBee Storage§r — Stores working bees\n§bCatalyst Slot§r — Insert a required catalyst\n§bOutput Grid§r — Collect produced items\n§bUpgrade Slots§r — Install machine upgrades\n\nPlace an Extension Box above or below\nto expand bee storage capacity.
ui.projectbee:info.advance_beehive_expanded=§eExpanded Advance Beehive§r\nExpanded beehive with additional bee\nstorage and output capacity.\n\n§bBee Input§r — Insert a filled bee cage\n§bBee Storage§r — Stores working bees (7 slots)\n§bCatalyst Slot§r — Insert a required catalyst\n§bOutput Grid§r — Collect produced items\n§bUpgrade Slots§r — Install machine upgrades
ui.projectbee:info.breeding_chamber=§eBreeding Chamber§r\nBreeds two bees to produce a new species.\n\n§bCage Slots§r — Insert two filled bee cages\n§bFlower Slots§r — Insert matching flowers\n§bOutput§r — Collect baby bee cages\n\nCages are not consumed.\nOne flower per slot consumed per cycle.
ui.projectbee:info.centrifuge=§eCentrifuge§r\nProcesses honeycombs into raw materials.\n\n§bInput Slot§r — Insert a honeycomb\n§bOutput Grid§r — Collect processed items
ui.projectbee:info.powered_centrifuge=§ePowered Centrifuge§r\nEnergy-powered centrifuge.\n\n§bInput Slot§r — Insert a honeycomb\n§bOutput Grid§r — Collect processed items\n\nRequires §aFE§r per operation.
ui.projectbee:info.feeding_slab=§eFeeding Slab§r\nHolds food items for the Advanced Beehive\nwhen simulator upgrade is installed.\n\n§bSlots§r — Place food blocks/items\n\nRight-click with another Feeding Slab\nto double the storage capacity.
ui.projectbee:info.feeding_slab_double=§eFeeding Slab (Double)§r\nExpanded feeding slab with 6 storage slots.\n\n§bSlots§r — Place food blocks/items

